(text "DATA WIRING ONLY - NOT A COMPLETE WORKING NVLINK IMPLEMENTATION" (at 25 208 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left)) (uuid "2bb5399b-d194-5a30-b0f2-2b2b1f640cde"))
(text "External NVLink clock required on EVERY V100: 156.25 MHz differential / Connector B E20=P, F20=N.\nSeparate PCIe clock: 100 MHz differential / Connector A E7=P, F7=N. Clock circuits are not included.\nUse suitable source/fanout outputs per GPU; also provide the required supplies, reset and supporting controls." (at 25 220 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left)) (uuid "657883a1-8959-59eb-9d4e-d81a5f507847"))
(text "REFERENCE SCOPE" (at 25 237 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "0f9feb89-c312-5b3c-ad15-8e1b133bdddc"))
(text "Full six-group two-GPU arrangement is derived from the documented pairing families.\nThis complete topology is not claimed as hardware-tested. Physical connector orientation and mating footprints require confirmation.\nCurated from the credited community sources; see the repository sources, connection guide and standalone workbook." (at 25 247 0) (effects (font (size 1.143 1.143)) (justify left)) (uuid "b49d0988-326f-5613-b90b-bf7c6205c5e4"))
